primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50231748", "author": {"steamid": "76561198275882705", "personaname": "左右互搏", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/oneaceelement/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1617, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1012, "last_played": 1679031566, "avatar": "46ac17eab7cf601af4f06a1691b38339ca0253d0"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "100+ms  玩屁   还不如以前", "timestamp_created": 1555763030, "timestamp_updated": 1555763030, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.461504131555557251", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50231241", "author": {"steamid": "76561198227983572", "personaname": "zyz123", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198227983572/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 32932, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1338, "last_played": 1726234654, "avatar": "6ff7642d6058e03f8f6611851368e210823446e8"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "强烈推荐，真是一天不玩我浑身难受。\n1.画风清奇，十分戳我的G点。\n2.打击感很棒，一发手雷下去虫尸遍地，断肢乱飞。\n3.环境渲染很出色，不同的地形带来不一样的奇特感受，犹如秘境探险，更重要的是，怪物种类也会发生变化，如辐射近卫，寒霜粘液轰炸蝇。\n4.游戏模式多样，几种不同的模式提供不一样的体验，有直线型的矿洞探险，亦有扩散式的定点采集，网状的虫蛋采集和定点猎杀亦有其亮点。\n5.职业定位清晰，各有特色，侦察兵勾爪飞檐走壁，翻山过海，照明枪就是全队的眼睛；枪手搭桥铺路，定点输出；工程师是侦查兵的好基友，勾爪与起平台可谓天造地和，自动炮塔提供更强的火力加持；钻机手火焰喷射器起火墙挡幼虫，炸药秒杀近卫，大钻头钻出捷径直达空降仓。", "timestamp_created": 1555760925, "timestamp_updated": 1555760925, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.570227921009063721", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": fals